menu "Brookesia Perf Eval"

config PERF_EVAL_NOTE
    bool
    default n

endmenu

# Declaring BROOKESIA_HAL_ADAPTOR_AUDIO_ENABLE_PROCESSOR_IMPL here is what made
# it worse: it redeclares a symbol hal_adaptor already owns, and a project
# Kconfig cannot extend a component symbol's definition, so the reference from
# esp_video resolved to neither. The real value comes from
# sdkconfig.defaults, which sets it to y so hal_adaptor's own declaration
# becomes active and defined.
#
# The FS letters are set the same way in sdkconfig.defaults for the same reason.
